<https://www.bco-dmo.org/dataset/905077> <https://schema.org/name> "[Ultrahigh Resolution Mass Spectrometry of a Depth Profile] - Ultrahigh resolution Mass Spectrometry data from a depth profile collected at 200 m depth intervals at the Bermuda Atlantic Time Series Station (BATS) in August 2019 and at the Hawaii Ocean Time Series station (HOTS) Aloha in July 2021 (The fate of lysis products of picocyanobacteria contributes to marine humic-like chromophoric dissolved organic matter)" .
<https://www.bco-dmo.org/dataset/905077> <https://schema.org/identifier> "bcodmo_dataset_905077_v1" .
<https://www.bco-dmo.org/dataset/905077> <https://schema.org/description> "This data set contains ultrahigh resolution mass spectrometric data collected at BATS and HOTS at 200 m depth intervals in August 2019, and July 2021, respectively.\n\ncdm_data_type = Other\nVARIABLES:\nStation_Location (unitless)\nlatitude (degrees_north)\nlongitude (degrees_east)\nDate (unitless)\nReplicate (unitless)\nDepth (meters (m))\nMass (unitless)\nIntensity (unitless)\n" .
<https://www.bco-dmo.org/dataset/905077> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Dataset> .
