<https://www.bco-dmo.org/dataset/813379> <https://schema.org/description> "This dataset contains depth profiles of seawater dissolved 232Th, 230Th, and 231Pa from cruise NBP1702 (GEOTRACES-compliant).\n\ncdm_data_type = Other\nVARIABLES:\nStation_ID (unitless)\nStart_Date_UTC (unitless)\nStart_Time_UTC (unitless)\ntime (Start ISO Date Time UTC, seconds since 1970-01-01T00:00:00Z)\nEnd_Date_UTC (unitless)\nEnd_Time_UTC (unitless)\nEnd_ISO_DateTime_UTC (End ISO Date Time UTC, unitless)\nlatitude (degrees_north)\nlongitude (degrees_east)\nEnd_Latitude (Latitude, degrees North)\nEnd_Longitude (Longitude, degrees East)\nEvent_ID (unitless)\nSample_ID (unitless)\ndepth (Sample Depth, m)\nTh_230_D_CONC_BOTTLE_xucmu6 (uBq/kg)\nSD1_Th_230_D_CONC_BOTTLE_xucmu6 (uBq/kg)\nFlag_Th_230_D_CONC_BOTTLE_xucmu6 (None)\nTh_232_D_CONC_BOTTLE_bwiimj (pmol/kg)\nSD1_Th_232_D_CONC_BOTTLE_bwiimj (pmol/kg)\nFlag_Th_232_D_CONC_BOTTLE_bwiimj (None)\nPa_231_D_CONC_BOTTLE_yq8ckw (uBq/kg)\nSD1_Pa_231_D_CONC_BOTTLE_yq8ckw (uBq/kg)\nFlag_Pa_231_D_CONC_BOTTLE_yq8ckw (None)\nTh_230_D_XS_CONC_BOTTLE (uBq/kg)\nTh_230_D_XS_CONC_BOTTLE_ERR (uBq/kg)\nTh_230_D_XS_CONC_BOTTLE_FLAG (none)\nPa_231_D_XS_CONC_BOTTLE (uBq/kg)\nPa_231_D_XS_CONC_BOTTLE_ERR (uBq/kg)\nPa_231_D_XS_CONC_BOTTLE_FLAG (none)\n" .
<https://www.bco-dmo.org/dataset/813379> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Dataset> .
