<https://www.bco-dmo.org/dataset/809612> <https://schema.org/name> "[GN01 Silicon Stable Isotopes] - Depth profiles of the isotopic composition (d30Si) of silicon within dissolved silicic acid on the US GEOTRACES Arctic cruise GN01 (HLY1502) from August to October 2015 (U.S. Arctic GEOTRACES Study)" .
<https://www.bco-dmo.org/dataset/809612> <https://schema.org/identifier> "bcodmo_dataset_809612" .
<https://www.bco-dmo.org/dataset/809612> <https://schema.org/description> "The isotopic composition of dissolved silicon (\\u03b430Si) has proven to be a powerful tool to better understand the marine Si cycle. The \\u03b430Si of seawater carries information about DSi utilization in surface waters, the subsequent dissolution of sinking biogenic material as well as water mass mixing. This data set supplies information on the spatial distribution of isotopes of Si within water masses in the Arctic Ocean from the Bering Strait to the north pole. Profiles of silicon isotopes within silicic acid, \\u03b430Si(OH)4, were obtained at a total of 15 stations on the GEOTRACES GN01 cruise\n\ncdm_data_type = Other\nVARIABLES:\nStation_ID (unitless)\nStart_Date_UTC (unitless)\nStart_Time_UTC (unitless)\ntime (Start ISO Date Time UTC, seconds since 1970-01-01T00:00:00Z)\nEnd_Date_UTC (unitless)\nEnd_Time_UTC (unitless)\nEnd_ISO_DateTime_UTC (End ISO Date Time UTC, unitless)\nlatitude (degrees_north)\nlongitude (degrees_east)\nEnd_Latitude (Latitude, decimal degrees)\nEnd_Longitude (Longitude, decimal degrees)\nEvent_ID (unitless)\nSample_ID (unitless)\ndepth (Sample Depth, m)\nSILICATE_30_28_D_DELTA_BOTTLE_5ib7da (Mass Concentration Of Silicate In Sea Water, per mil)\nSD1_SILICATE_30_28_D_DELTA_BOTTLE_5ib7da (Mass Concentration Of Silicate In Sea Water, per mil)\nFlag_SILICATE_30_28_D_DELTA_BOTTLE_5ib7da (unitless)\n" .
<https://www.bco-dmo.org/dataset/809612> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Dataset> .
