<https://www.bco-dmo.org/dataset/806105> <https://schema.org/description> "Sediment pore water and solid phase geochemical analyses from samples collected on R/V Savannah cruise SAV-17-15 in the Gulf of Mexico during July and August 2017.\n\ncdm_data_type = Other\nVARIABLES:\nYear (unitless)\nMonth (unitless)\nDay (unitless)\nCollection_Type (unitless)\nStation (unitless)\nlongitude (degrees_east)\nlatitude (degrees_north)\nsample_ID (unitless)\nSediment_depth (centimeters (cm))\nFe_II (micromolar (uM))\nsdFe_II (Sd Fe II, micromolar (uM))\nFed (micromolar (uM))\nsdFed (Sd Fed, micromolar (uM))\nFe_III_d (micromolar (uM))\nsdFe_III_d (Sd Fe III D, micromolar (uM))\nDIC (millimolar (mM))\nsdDIC (Sd DIC, millimolar (mM))\nPO4 (Mass Concentration Of Phosphate In Sea Water, micromolar (uM))\nsdPO4 (Sd PO4, micromolar (uM))\nMnd (micromolar (uM))\nsdMnd (SD MND, micromolar (uM))\nNH4 (Mole Concentration Of Ammonium In Sea Water, micromolar (uM))\nsdNH4 (SD NH4, micromolar (uM))\nNO2 (Mole Concentration Of Nitrite In Sea Water, micromolar (uM))\nsdNO2 (Sd NO2, micromolar (uM))\nBr (micromolar (uM))\n... (10 more variables)\n" .
