<https://www.bco-dmo.org/dataset/768110> <https://schema.org/description> "Physical description of marine lakes including surface area, distance to ocean, tidal efficiency, depth, and stratification.\n\ncdm_data_type = Other\nVARIABLES:\nlake (unitless)\nlake_code (unitless)\nvolume_m3 (meters^3)\nsurface_area_m2 (meters^2)\ndistance_to_ocean_min_m (meters)\ndistance_to_ocean_mean_m (meters)\ndistance_to_ocean_median_m (meters)\ntidal_lag_time_minutes (minutes)\ntidal_efficiency (unitless)\nmean_transect_length_m (meters)\ndepth (Max Actual Depth M, m)\nperimeter_m (meters)\nhabitable_surface_area_cylinder (meters^2)\nhabitable_surface_area_frustum (meters^2)\nstratified (unitless)\n" .
