<https://www.bco-dmo.org/dataset/743274> <https://schema.org/name> "[SO248: GF FLA hydrolysis rates] - Microbial enzyme activities: polysaccharide hydrolase activities of gravity filtered seawater samples from the RV\\Sonne cruise SO248 in the South and North Pacific, along 180 W, May, 2016 (Latitudinal and depth-related contrasts in enzymatic capabilities of pelagic microbial communities: Predictable patterns in the ocean?)" .
<https://www.bco-dmo.org/dataset/743274> <https://schema.org/identifier> "bcodmo_dataset_743274" .
<https://www.bco-dmo.org/dataset/743274> <https://schema.org/description> "This dataset includes polysaccharide hydrolysis rates measured on particles collected from gravity-filtered seawater. Gravity filtered samples were collected on RV/Sonne cruise SO248 in May 2016. Links to archived CTD data are also provided.\n\ncdm_data_type = Other\nVARIABLES:\nstation_no (unitless)\ncast_no (unitless)\ntime (ISO Date Time UTC, seconds since 1970-01-01T00:00:00Z)\nlatitude (degrees_north)\nlongitude (degrees_east)\ndepth_no (Depth, unitless)\ndepth (m)\nsubstrate (unitless)\ntimepoint (unitless)\ntime_elapsed_hr (hours)\nrep1_rate (nanomoles/liter/hour (nmol L-1 h-1))\nrep2_rate (nanomoles/liter/hour (nmol L-1 h-1))\naverage (nanomoles/liter/hour (nmol L-1 h-1))\nstd_dev (nanomoles/liter/hour (nmol L-1 h-1))\nfilter_um (micrometers)\n" .
<https://www.bco-dmo.org/dataset/743274> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Dataset> .
