<https://www.bco-dmo.org/dataset/742819> <https://schema.org/name> "[NBP1608 Station Nutrients] - Dissolved macronutrient concentrations from depth profiles from RVIB Nathaniel B. Palmer cruise NBP1608 in the Southern Ocean from September to October 2016 (Collaborative Research: Investigating Iron-binding Ligands in Southern Ocean Diatom Communities: The Role of Diatom-Bacteria Associations)" .
<https://www.bco-dmo.org/dataset/742819> <https://schema.org/identifier> "bcodmo_dataset_742819" .
<https://www.bco-dmo.org/dataset/742819> <https://schema.org/description> "Dissolved macronutrient concentrations from depth profiles from RVIB Nathaniel B. Palmer cruise NBP1608 in the Southern Ocean from September to October 2016.\n\ncdm_data_type = Other\nVARIABLES:\nEVTNBR (unitless)\nDATE (unitless)\nGMT (unitless)\ntime (ISO Date Time GMT, seconds since 1970-01-01T00:00:00Z)\nlatitude (degrees_north)\nlongitude (degrees_east)\nPLATFORM (unitless)\nCASTNBR (unitless)\nSTNNBR (unitless)\nBTLNBR (unitless)\ndepth (m)\nNO3_NO2 (micromoles per liter (uM))\nNO3_NO2_STDEV (micromoles per liter (uM))\nNO3_NO2_pcnt_RSD (unitless (percent))\nNO3_NO2_INSTR (unitless)\nPO4 (micromoles per liter (uM))\nPO4_STDEV (micromoles per liter (uM))\nPO4_pcnt_RSD (unitless (percent))\nPO4_INSTR (unitless)\nSiO4 (Si O4, micromoles per liter (uM))\nSiO4_STDEV (Si O4 STDEV, micromoles per liter (uM))\nSiO4_pcnt_RSD (Si O4 Pcnt RSD, unitless (percent))\nSiO4_INSTR (Si O4 INSTR, unitless)\nNO2 (micromoles per liter (uM))\nNO2_STDEV (micromoles per liter (uM))\nNO2_pcnt_RSD (unitless (percent))\n... (5 more variables)\n" .
<https://www.bco-dmo.org/dataset/742819> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Dataset> .
