<https://www.bco-dmo.org/dataset/737347> <https://schema.org/name> "[Tagged kelp size and depth] - Kelp plant size, holdfast size, and depth from five transects at three sites in Santa Barbara Channel, 2015 to 2017 (Linking nearshore kelp forest dynamics to sandy beach ecosystems)" .
