<https://www.bco-dmo.org/dataset/737347> <https://schema.org/description> "This dataset reports depth and size of kelp found along five transects in Santa Barbara Channel in summer of 2015 and 2016, and fall of 2017.\n\ncdm_data_type = Other\nVARIABLES:\nYear (unitlesss)\nSite (unitlesss)\nTransect (unitlesss)\nTag_id (unitlesss)\nMonth (unitlesss)\nDay (unitlesss)\nDepth_ft (Depth, feet)\ndepth_m (Depth, meters)\nDistance_m (meters)\nFronds_1_m (meters)\nMax_diameter_1_cm (centimeters)\nOrthogonal_diameter_cm (centimeters)\n" .
