<https://www.bco-dmo.org/dataset/692279> <https://schema.org/description> "Doliolid abundance, carbon and nitrogen content, chlorophyll-a, temperature, salinity, and depth from CTD casts from 25 RV Savannah cruises at the South Atlantic Bight, 2015-2017.\n\ncdm_data_type = Other\nVARIABLES:\ncruise_id (unitless)\nalt_cruise_id (unitless)\ncast (unitless)\ndate_local (unitless)\ndepth (m)\nlatitude (degrees_north)\nlongitude (degrees_east)\ntemp_surface (degrees Celsius)\ntemp_bottom (degrees Celsius)\nsal_surface (Practical Salinity Units (PSU))\nsal_bottom (Practical Salinity Units (PSU))\nchla_surface_fluor (Concentration Of Chlorophyll In Sea Water, mg m-3)\nchla_bottom_fluor (Concentration Of Chlorophyll In Sea Water, mg m-3)\nchla_nr_bot_extr (Concentration Of Chlorophyll In Sea Water, mg m-3)\nphaeo_total_nr_bot_extr (mg m-3)\ngt8uml_chla_nr_bot_extr (Concentration Of Chlorophyll In Sea Water, mg m-3)\ngt8uml_phaeo_nr_bot_extr (mg m-3)\nPOC_ug (ug C L-1)\nPOC_moles (moles C L-1)\nPON_ug (ug N L-1)\nPON_moles (moles N L-1)\nlt10um_POC_ug (ug C L-1)\nlt10um_POC_moles (moles C L-1)\nlt10um_PON_ug (ug N L-1)\nlt10um_PON_moles (moles N L-1)\nPOC_13C (POC 13 C, per mil vs PDB standard)\n... (11 more variables)\n" .
<https://www.bco-dmo.org/dataset/692279> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Dataset> .
