<https://www.bco-dmo.org/dataset/4049> <https://schema.org/name> "[Stillwater Cove temperature time series] - Temperature time-series data from 4 depths in the Central California kelp forest, measured at the Stillwater Cove Mooring from 2010-2012 (Climate Change Kelp project) (Effects of ocean climate change on recruitment of kelp populations)" .
<https://www.bco-dmo.org/dataset/4049> <https://schema.org/identifier> "bcodmo_dataset_4049" .
<https://www.bco-dmo.org/dataset/4049> <https://schema.org/description> "Temperature data from 4 depths at the study site in the giant kelp forest habitat of the Central California Coast. Temperature was recorded every 5 minutes from June 2010 to October 2012.\n\ncdm_data_type = Other\nVARIABLES:\nsite (text)\nsite_descrip (text)\nlatitude (degrees_north)\nlongitude (degrees_east)\ndepth (m)\ndepth_comment (Depth, text)\nyear_local (unitless)\nmonth_local (unitless)\nday_local (unitless)\ntime_local (unitless)\ntemp (Temperature, degrees Celsius)\nyrday_local (dimensionless)\nISO_DateTime_Local (ISO Date Time Local, unitless)\n" .
<https://www.bco-dmo.org/dataset/4049> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Dataset> .
