<https://www.bco-dmo.org/dataset/3236> <https://schema.org/description> "Southern Ocean 2001 moorings: depth and pressure vs. time from ARSV Laurence M. Gould LMG0103, LMG0201A in the Southern Ocean from 2001-2002.\n\ncdm_data_type = Other\nVARIABLES:\nmooring\nyear_start\nlatitude (degrees_north)\nlongitude (degrees_east)\ndepth_w (Depth, meters)\nrotangle (degrees)\ndepth (m)\nyrday_gmt\njulian_day\npress (decibars)\nyear\nmonth_gmt\nday_gmt\nhour_gmt (whole hours)\nminute_gmt (whole minutes)\n" .
